  "_doc": "Per-agent permissions enforced by scripts/guard.py. Agents not listed here are not restricted by this guard. 'write': glob patterns relative to the project root that the agent may write; 'write_except': globs it may never write ('!pattern' re-includes); 'write_if_conflicted': may edit files that contain merge-conflict markers; 'deps_check': runtime package additions must be approved in .sdd/dependencies.yaml; 'bash': regexes a command must fully match (chaining and redirection always denied); 'mcp': 'read-only' denies MCP tools whose name looks like a write. '__hub__' lists the main session's bookkeeping actions that are auto-approved; everything else in the main session keeps normal prompts. In-policy actions are auto-approved unless .sdd/config.yaml sets permissions.auto_approve: false.",
